[ti:1-06-感谢信]
[00:00.00]Dear Wang Lei,
[00:01.27]Thank you very much for those five wonderful days at your house！
[00:06.90]Every moment was a delight.
[00:09.34]I can’t remember ever having enjoyed myself so thoroughly elsewhere.
[00:15.60]This is to tell you again how much I enjoyed the weekend in Hangzhou.
[00:21.55]Everything was just perfect: the weather,
[00:25.37]your company,
[00:26.64]the beautiful surroundings—no wonder I’m finding it difficult to get down to reading this morning！
[00:35.56]The classroom life seems so dull and prosaic compared to the days in Hangzhou.
[00:42.46]I hope you know how much I appreciate your hospitality and your thoughtful kindness to me.
[00:50.43]I count myself fortunate indeed to have such a generous and charming friend as you.
[00:57.75]I hope something will bring you to Beijing soon so that I can reciprocate your great kindness.
